    text: "Affected stops:\r\nW 7th Ave & Galapago St (#11721) (northbound)\r\nW 7th Ave & Santa Fe Dr (#11723) (northbound)\r\nSanta Fe Dr & W 8th Ave (#16421) (northbound)\r\nW 7th Ave & Inca St (#20579) (southbound)\r\nW 7th Ave & Galapago St (#20580) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound ART get on/off buses at:\r\nGalapago St & W 6th Ave (#14023)\r\nSanta Fe Dr & W 11th Ave (#16418)\r\n\nFor southbound ART get on/off buses at:\r\nKalamath St & W 9th Ave (#14722)\r\nGalapago St & W 6th Ave (#14024)"
